Adds GET/HEAD / and Ollama-style /api/status, /api/experimental/model-recommendations, /api/show to vllm's FastAPI app so ollama launch codex can discover the model and read its context length (256k) without a proxy. model-recommendations returns [] so codex falls back to the model name it was given.

